# Inspiring Paladin: "During your turn, creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them have first strike." Bot1's Ajani's Pridemate
# gets a +1/+1 counter from a Healing Salve on turn 1 (3/3) and has first strike on that turn and on turn 3, while a Memnite without a
# counter cast on turn 3 does not (CR 613.1f). It has none on Bot2's turn 2. When Bot2 bolts the Paladin on turn 3 the Pridemate loses
# first strike again: the grant is the Paladin's.

